# 3b. Teleport above every cell (NET-RESIDENCY-HEIGHT-OUTCOME): (40000, 3000) is in cells of the grid, but y = 10 km is
# past their content height grown by the search's column (lift / drop), so ServerWorld::ResidencyAt's height check
# says NoCell and states WHY (Net::PointResidency::Note: the cells there and the y span they reach); Teleport refuses
# with that reason and nothing is queued. [teleport_search_nodefault] is these log lines: no default height, no
# fallback placement.
